{"municipality_code":"14104","pref":"神奈川県","city":"横浜市中区","headline":"貴重な土木遺産があります。","display_comment_enriched":"横浜市中区には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「太田陣屋跡」、「横浜町会所跡」、「横浜正金銀行」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では吉川英治や大佛次郎に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":364,"rank":283,"percentile":85.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":81,"rank":260,"percentile":86.1,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":24,"rank":1044,"percentile":43.0,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":29,"rank":152,"percentile":91.3,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":65,"rank":2,"percentile":99.9,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":2,"rank":1181,"percentile":27.7,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":7,"rank":631,"percentile":63.2,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":2,"rank":1510,"percentile":17.6,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":3,"rank":10,"percentile":98.4,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["吉川英治","大佛次郎","夏目雅子","江川宇礼雄","周富徳"],"tourism_landm